00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.800
- What is Oprah's one word?

00:00:05.596 --> 00:00:07.994
So as you guys probably know by know

00:00:07.994 --> 00:00:10.033
I've written a book
called "Your One Word,"

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:12.635
which is about finding your one core value

00:00:12.635 --> 00:00:15.727
that makes you come alive,
that represents who you are,

00:00:15.727 --> 00:00:17.766
when you understand what you stand for,

00:00:17.766 --> 00:00:20.004
then you can build a life
and a business with meaning

00:00:20.004 --> 00:00:21.955
and purpose and that is valuable.

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.502
And so I thought what might be interesting

00:00:23.502 --> 00:00:25.419
is showing off some famous entrepreneurs

00:00:25.419 --> 00:00:27.979
and understanding what is their one word

00:00:27.979 --> 00:00:29.848
that makes them tic.

00:00:29.848 --> 00:00:32.370
Up first, Oprah Winfrey.

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:35.203
- What is your brand do you think?

00:00:36.081 --> 00:00:38.592
- I'm the love brand.

00:00:38.592 --> 00:00:39.693
- Aren't we all darling?

00:00:39.693 --> 00:00:40.914
- [Oprah] No I'm the love brand.

00:00:40.914 --> 00:00:41.975
- Aren't we all.

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.316
- I'm the love brand.

00:00:43.316 --> 00:00:45.758
- You like to shower love around?

00:00:45.758 --> 00:00:47.786
- Yeah, it's really, that's what it is,

00:00:47.786 --> 00:00:48.746
I am the love and connection brand.

00:00:48.746 --> 00:00:49.682
- [Piers] Love that!

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:50.515
- That's what I am.

00:00:50.515 --> 00:00:52.039
- You're a bit like Barry
White, the love god,

00:00:52.039 --> 00:00:53.504
you're the love brand.

00:00:53.504 --> 00:00:56.072
- I'm the love brand because ultimately

00:00:56.072 --> 00:00:58.191
everything that I'm saying whether it's in

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:01.566
my magazine, whether
it's Gayle on the radio,

00:01:01.566 --> 00:01:04.414
whether it's the Oprah Winfrey Show

00:01:04.414 --> 00:01:07.389
and now everything about the channel OWN,

00:01:07.389 --> 00:01:11.830
it's about opening your
space, you heart space

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.054
so that you can love more.

00:01:13.054 --> 00:01:15.494
You know that's really all money is for,

00:01:15.494 --> 00:01:17.532
money's worth nothing if it can't buy you

00:01:17.532 --> 00:01:19.949
the opportunity to love more.

00:01:20.905 --> 00:01:22.289
- Thank you guys so much for watching,

00:01:22.289 --> 00:01:23.794
I hope you enjoyed the clip.

00:01:23.794 --> 00:01:26.723
I'd love to know what your one word is

00:01:26.723 --> 00:01:29.249
if you want to leave it
down in the comments below,

00:01:29.249 --> 00:01:31.488
again I appreciate your viewership,

00:01:31.488 --> 00:01:33.236
I believe in you, I hope you continue

00:01:33.236 --> 00:01:37.100
to believe in yourself and
whatever your one word is,

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.767
much love and I'll see you soon.

